{"id":"cbf54d50c77440e3","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-zfc-rud-closed-set.md","title":"ZFC Rud Closed Set","display":"df-zfc-rud-closed-set — ZFC Rud Closed Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-rud-closed-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-rud-closed-set"],"display":"df-zfc-rud-closed-set — ZFC Rud Closed Set","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-rudimentary-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-rud-closed-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-rud-closed-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-rud-closed-set — ZFC Rud Closed Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d83d7732ede02eef\" href=\"?note=d83d7732ede02eef\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-zfc-rudimentary-function.md\">../batch20/58-df-zfc-rudimentary-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,c,n\\in V\">\\(A,c,n\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RudimentaryFunctionCode}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{RudimentaryFunctionCode}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (带元数的 rudimentary-function 代码谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d83d7732ede02eef\" href=\"?note=d83d7732ede02eef\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-zfc-rudimentary-function.md\">../batch20/58-df-zfc-rudimentary-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EvalRud}(c,\\vec a)\">\\(\\operatorname{EvalRud}(c,\\vec a)\\)</span> (由上游代码语法结构递归唯一确定的标准求值)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RudClosedSet}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{RudClosedSet}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rud\\text{-}closed\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RudClosedSet}_S(A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall c\\in V\\;\\left(\\mathrm{RudimentaryFunctionCode}_S(c,n)\\to\n\\forall\\vec a\\in A^n\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{EvalRud}(c,\\vec a)\\in A\\bigr)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rud\\text{-}closed\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RudClosedSet}_S(A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall c\\in V\\;\\left(\\mathrm{RudimentaryFunctionCode}_S(c,n)\\to\n\\forall\\vec a\\in A^n\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{EvalRud}(c,\\vec a)\\in A\\bigr)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>闭包量化上游实际导出的“代码—元数”二元谓词；全宇宙 rudimentary 运算通过代码结构递归求值，不再被误写成集合函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V^n\\to V\">\\(V^n\\to V\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-zfc-rudimentary-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"d83d7732ede02eef","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-rudimentary-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-zfc-rudimentary-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"d83d7732ede02eef","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RudimentaryFunctionCode}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (带元数的 rudimentary-function 代码谓词, see [[../batch20/58-df-zfc-rudimentary-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,c,n\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RudimentaryFunctionCode}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{EvalRud}(c,\\vec a)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RudClosedSet}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rud\\text{-}closed\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RudClosedSet}_S(A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall c\\in V\\;\\left(\\mathrm{RudimentaryFunctionCode}_S(c,n)\\to\n\\forall\\vec a\\in A^n\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{EvalRud}(c,\\vec a)\\in A\\bigr)\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"V^n\\to V","display":false}],"bytes":1161,"backlinks":[{"id":"d4768eaba2d6f60b","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RudClosedSet}_S$ (rudimentary-closure predicate, see [[../batch18/58-df-zfc-rud-closed-set.md]])"},{"id":"461c938c18579fad","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RudClosedSet}_S$ (closure under every rudimentary function, see [[../batch18/58-df-zfc-rud-closed-set]])"},{"id":"b31a642a9ecd8d64","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RudClosedSet}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-zfc-rud-closed-set]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3331","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-rud-closed-set.md|58-df-zfc-rud-closed-set]]（batch18）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","d83d7732ede02eef"]}